# Local-only sandbox scripts.
#
# Drop *.jar files here to have them seeded into the sandboxed `mock` flavor on startup
# (see SandboxScriptSeeder). They are bundled into the app's resources ONLY for the mock flavor,
# so they never ship in production builds (-Pflavor=prod).
#
# These JARs are intentionally NOT committed — keep them local.
#
# Requirements per JAR:
#   - plaintext/unencrypted (the sandbox runs environment=local)
#   - contains a valid manifest.json at the root (package_name, name, version_code, script)
#   - filename must not be "release.jar" (reserved for the bundled :cereal-script-sample)
*.jar
!.gitignore
!README.md
